Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{=34}===============================DIALOGUE============================
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.90,0:00:07.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's Rob Lucci!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.24,0:00:11.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Then it's true. They came here to kill\NVegapunk, just as he feared that they would.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.99,0:00:15.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who the hell invited you, Pigeon Guy?\NYou get outta here!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.96,0:00:20.54,Main-207+,Lucci,0,0,0,,This is a Government island.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.86,0:00:18.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.04,0:00:22.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh crap, you're right!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.21,0:00:24.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're the ones who aren't\Nsupposed to be here!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.38,0:00:27.72,Main-207+,Chopper,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NAh! Will you focus?\NNone of that matters!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.72,0:00:30.30,Main-207+,Chopper,0,0,0,,Come on, Luffy! We gotta get\Nto the upper level, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.30,0:00:32.64,Main-207+,Kaku,0,0,0,,[KAKU]\NThe Straw Hats, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.64,0:00:34.56,Main-207+,Kaku,0,0,0,,Didn't know this place had a pest problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.56,0:00:36.93,Main-207+,Kaku,0,0,0,,Jewelry Bonney, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.31,0:00:40.35,Main-207+,Kaku,0,0,0,,But we can't do anything yet, Lucci!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.35,0:00:44.82,Main-207+,Kaku,0,0,0,,{\q2}Remember, Straw Hat is an Emperor of the Sea now,\NWe can't fight him without permission from the top.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.28,0:00:46.40,Main-207+,Stussy,0,0,0,,[STUSSY]\NHe's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.40,0:00:48.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Four Emperors often have powerful allies.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.95,0:00:51.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,One little scuffle could lead to a war.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.57,0:00:53.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Send a report to the Navy now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.83,0:00:54.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Roger!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.99,0:00:57.83,Main-207+,Lucci,0,0,0,,I'm not sure we can avoid a fight so easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.87,0:01:04.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gotta go, Jinbe! Hold Bonney!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.01,0:01:14.39,Main-207+,Chopper,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NLuffy, what's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.14,0:01:16.64,Main-207+,Chopper,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.39,0:01:19.64,Main-207+,Chopper,0,0,0,,Wait, I know her!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.31,0:01:21.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's that girl from before!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.31,0:01:24.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Chopper! Help her, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.32,0:01:32.57,Main-207+,Chopper,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NI'm sorry, but. I think\Nthis is more Franky's specialty than mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.41,0:01:42.42,Main-207+,Lucci,0,0,0,,[LUCCI]\NThis is Government business.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.42,0:01:45.44,Main-207+,Lucci,0,0,0,,You would be wise to stay out of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.50,0:01:52.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,She fed us. She took care of us when we\Ncame here, and that makes her a friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.31,0:03:33.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The straw hats are on Egghead?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.65,0:03:35.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why, dammit?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.11,0:03:36.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,See this?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.11,0:03:40.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You give people an inch\Nand they give you nothing but a headache.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.70,0:03:45.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He must have figured out that CP0 was there\Nto kill them. That's not a good sign.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.54,0:03:49.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir. That's likely why they had\Nto use S-Bear to teleport inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.21,0:03:54.34,Main-207+,Akainu,0,0,0,,[AKAINU]\NAnd what they did is declare war.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.84,0:03:59.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I wish they'd had the common sense\Nto contact... Me first! Those arrogant brats.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.18,0:04:04.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If Vegapunk has the Straw Hats on his side,\Nthis could be a real disaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.06,0:04:07.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Who knows how many good Marines we could lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.52,0:04:09.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where's Kizaru?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.35,0:04:12.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's on his way to Egghead right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.27,0:04:16.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He was already en route\Nin service of a different mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.53,0:04:20.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tell Lucci to avoid any further action\Nuntil backup arrives.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.24,0:04:21.16,Main-207+,Marine Officers,0,0,0,,[MARINE OFFICERS]\NSir!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.91,0:04:26.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No matter what happens,\Nwe cannot let him fight Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.21,0:04:31.58,Main-207+,Pythagoras,0,0,0,,{\i1}[PYTHAGORAS]\NIntruder alert!\NEvacuate immediately!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.58,0:04:33.46,Main-207+,Pythagoras,0,0,0,,{\i1}I repeat, evacuate immediately!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.05,0:04:36.46,Main-207+,Pythagoras,0,0,0,,You take Bonney, I'll take her.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.84,0:04:39.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ah, We need to get her to Franky right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.84,0:04:42.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You ready, Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.43,0:04:48.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Go on without me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.63,0:06:01.88,Main-207+,Lucci,0,0,0,,What was that form in your wanted poster?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.05,0:06:06.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What, you wanna see it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.05,0:06:08.56,Main-207+,Lucci,0,0,0,,Do you need to ask?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.05,0:06:49.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I feel it, I feel it, I feel it, I feel it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.68,0:06:51.14,Main-207+,Kaku,0,0,0,,[KAKU]\NWhat the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.19,0:07:45.19,Main-207+,Lucci,0,0,0,,I'll be damned.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.19,0:07:47.03,Main-207+,Lucci,0,0,0,,This should be fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.01,0:08:10.05,Main-207+,Kaku,0,0,0,,[KAKU]\NLucci.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.98,0:08:20.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, yoo-hoo,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.02,0:08:21.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pigeon guy,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.73,0:08:24.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,get over here! Let's fight some more!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.74,0:08:33.83,Main-207+,Lucci,0,0,0,,[LUCCI]\NStill playing games,\Neven when your life is on the line?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.45,0:08:37.16,Main-207+,Lucci,0,0,0,,I'm starting to get annoyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.16,0:09:10.79,Main-207+,Lucci,0,0,0,,[LUCCI]\NDon't get cocky, Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.20,0:09:16.74,Main-207+,Lucci,0,0,0,,I've gotten stronger, just like you have.\NAll the better to eat prey like you alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.21,0:09:20.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait, something's different!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.92,0:09:23.58,Main-207+,Usopp,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NHe definitely didn't look\Nlike that before!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.04,0:09:28.55,Main-207+,Kaku,0,0,0,,[KAKU]\NStop, Lucci!\NWe don't have authorization for this!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.05,0:09:34.89,Main-207+,Shaka,0,0,0,,[SHAKA]\NHis speed is incredible,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.89,0:09:36.68,Main-207+,Shaka,0,0,0,,but so is his control!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.68,0:09:40.43,Main-207+,Shaka,0,0,0,,It's rare that an awakened zoan user\Ncan maintain their state of mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.97,0:10:16.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Please, think of the position you're in!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.05,0:10:17.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Government will hunt you down for this!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.36,0:10:27.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shaka!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.07,0:10:30.40,Main-207+,Vegapunk,0,0,0,,What happened? Did\Nthe white-haired warrior appear?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.40,0:10:32.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh my god, real Vegapunk!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.15,0:10:34.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How in the hell did he get up here so fast?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.24,0:10:38.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Remarkable!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.45,0:10:41.54,Main-207+,Vegapunk,0,0,0,,Tell me more! I must know everything\Nabout this transformation!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.00,0:10:43.75,Main-207+,Vegapunk,0,0,0,,What is that form?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.75,0:10:46.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, it's new, so we don't know much, either,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.13,0:10:48.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but it's a Gum-Gum thing, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.30,0:10:54.68,Main-207+,Vegapunk,0,0,0,,That's a Devil Fruit Encyclopedia,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.68,0:10:59.39,Main-207+,Vegapunk,0,0,0,,There is no mention of a Gum-Gum Fruit.\NThis must be something else!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.39,0:11:00.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.06,0:11:03.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait, are you saying it's a different devil fruit?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.43,0:11:06.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If that's true, then why does he say\NGum-Gum all the time?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.44,0:11:13.24,Main-207+,Vegapunk,0,0,0,,[VEGAPUNK]\NHe's so beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.07,0:11:16.99,Main-207+,Vegapunk,0,0,0,,There is a figure from the ancient past.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.99,0:11:19.99,Main-207+,Vegapunk,0,0,0,,One with the same form\Nyour captain has now!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.62,0:11:24.16,Main-207+,Vegapunk,0,0,0,,A god from the old texts!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.66,0:11:25.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A god?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.96,0:11:27.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.42,0:11:28.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stupid incarnate, Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.38,0:11:31.30,Main-207+,Vegapunk,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.90,0:11:39.04,Main-207+,Vegapunk,0,0,0,,The Warrior of Liberation.\NHe who plays the fool and brings smiles to all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.70,0:11:41.81,Main-207+,Vegapunk,0,0,0,,There's no mistaking him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.43,0:11:44.14,Main-207+,Vegapunk,0,0,0,,He is the Sun God!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.14,0:11:44.98,Main-207+,Vegapunk,0,0,0,,Nika!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.35,0:11:50.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nika? I've never heard of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.86,0:11:52.48,Main-207+,Vegapunk,0,0,0,,That's no surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.48,0:11:55.07,Main-207+,Vegapunk,0,0,0,,The World Government erased\Nhis name from history.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.53,0:12:00.82,Main-207+,Vegapunk,0,0,0,,But as long as people yearn for the Warrior\Nof Liberation, he will never truly disappear!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.99,0:12:05.25,Main-207+,Vegapunk,0,0,0,,For it is desire that brings forth\Neverything in this world!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.25,0:12:07.08,Main-207+,Vegapunk,0,0,0,,Take for example
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.46,0:12:09.54,Main-207+,Vegapunk,0,0,0,,the devil fruits and all their power!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.54,0:12:12.63,Main-207+,Vegapunk,0,0,0,,You can see it, can't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.80,0:12:19.05,Main-207+,Vegapunk,0,0,0,,[VEGAPUNK]\NEach devil fruit is a possibility\Nfor evolution that someone desires!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.05,0:12:20.84,Main-207+,Vegapunk,0,0,0,,I wish I could do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.84,0:12:22.81,Main-207+,Vegapunk,0,0,0,,I wish I could do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.81,0:12:26.77,Main-207+,Vegapunk,0,0,0,,All of the powers represent\Npotential futures of humanity!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.18,0:12:30.40,Main-207+,Vegapunk,0,0,0,,But these fantastic possibilities\Nare not a natural
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.40,0:12:35.77,Main-207+,Vegapunk,0,0,0,,part of this world, so the mother of nature,\Nthe sea, rejects them!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.36,0:12:38.99,Main-207+,Vegapunk,0,0,0,,Therefore, you might say...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.95,0:12:47.61,Main-207+,Vegapunk,0,0,0,,Those who have powers live\Nin different realities.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.00,0:12:51.69,Main-207+,Vegapunk,0,0,0,,Realities someone dreamed up!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.80,0:12:58.26,Main-207+,Vegapunk,0,0,0,,[VEGAPUNK]\NThat is my hypothesis!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.59,0:13:03.72,Main-207+,Vegapunk,0,0,0,,One where god's existence is irrelevant!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.93,0:13:07.89,Main-207+,Vegapunk,0,0,0,,What an interesting world, wouldn't you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.77,0:13:17.74,Main-207+,Sentomaru,0,0,0,,[SENTOMARU]\NDo those idiots know\Nwhere they're fighting? This isn't a playground!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.36,0:13:20.78,Main-207+,Sentomaru,0,0,0,,{\an8}Not for pirates, and not for CP0, either!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.91,0:13:26.04,Main-207+,Sentomaru,0,0,0,,Why are you bothering me on my day off?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.04,0:13:27.87,Main-207+,Vegapunk,0,0,0,,{\i1}[VEGAPUNK]\NWhy did you take\Nso long to answer?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.75,0:13:31.00,Main-207+,Sentomaru,0,0,0,,Whatever! I'm here, aren't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.00,0:13:32.33,Main-207+,Sentomaru,0,0,0,,So what's the plan, Punk?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.33,0:13:34.84,Main-207+,Sentomaru,0,0,0,,Cipher Pol is our ally, and
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.84,0:13:36.30,Main-207+,Sentomaru,0,0,0,,the pirates are the enemy, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.05,0:13:40.01,Main-207+,Sentomaru,0,0,0,,{\q2}Do you want me to just back up CP0, or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.34,0:13:42.93,Main-207+,Vegapunk,0,0,0,,{\i1}[VEGAPUNK]\NQuite the opposite, I'm afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.30,0:13:47.18,Main-207+,Vegapunk,0,0,0,,{\i1}CP0 is here to assassinate me,\Nso I need your help to escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.14,0:13:51.19,Main-207+,Vegapunk,0,0,0,,{\i1}[VEGAPUNK]\NDon't get caught up\Nin the details. Just keep them away!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.19,0:13:52.44,Main-207+,Sentomaru,0,0,0,,I can't do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.44,0:13:54.92,Main-207+,Sentomaru,0,0,0,,Do you know what they do to traitors?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.31,0:13:56.57,Main-207+,Vegapunk,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.57,0:13:59.78,Main-207+,Vegapunk,0,0,0,,My apologies. But let me ask you this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.15,0:14:01.70,Main-207+,Vegapunk,0,0,0,,{\i1}Sentomaru?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.70,0:14:04.66,Main-207+,Vegapunk,0,0,0,,Can't you do this one teensy favor for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.03,0:14:08.52,Main-207+,Vegapunk,0,0,0,,The man who saved you from poverty?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.70,0:14:10.41,Main-207+,Vegapunk,0,0,0,,All those years ago?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.29,0:14:14.29,Main-207+,Sentomaru,0,0,0,,Wow! No pressure, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.59,0:14:23.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is he going to attack us?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.14,0:14:27.39,Main-207+,Kaku,0,0,0,,[KAKU]\NThree seraphim.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.72,0:14:30.06,Main-207+,Kaku,0,0,0,,I'm not looking forward to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.97,0:14:32.48,Main-207+,Kaku,0,0,0,,S-Bear!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.48,0:14:33.69,Main-207+,Kaku,0,0,0,,Thin out their numbers!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.15,0:14:37.27,Main-207+,Sentomaru,0,0,0,,S-Bear! Don't move!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.69,0:14:41.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We can't beat them. Not like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.28,0:14:42.53,Main-207+,Sentomaru,0,0,0,,Go, S-Bear!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.53,0:14:44.49,Main-207+,Sentomaru,0,0,0,,Take out CP0. They're the enemy!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.04,0:14:51.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Retreat!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.00,0:15:02.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We need a new plan, and fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.84,0:15:03.63,Main-207+,Kaku,0,0,0,,[KAKU]\NNo kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.01,0:15:08.60,Main-207+,Kaku,0,0,0,,So the issue is that Sentomaru outranks\Nthe Authority Chips we're carrying?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.97,0:15:09.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.72,0:15:16.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}The system of control is a hierarchy. If someone who's higher\Nranked gives an order, that's the order the seraphim will follow.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.60,0:15:20.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The highest on the authority chain\Nare the Five Elders.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.15,0:15:25.74,Main-207+,Stussi,0,0,0,,[STUSSI]\NThe second highest is Dr. Vegapunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.78,0:15:28.78,Main-207+,Stussi,0,0,0,,The third is Sentomaru.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.95,0:15:34.08,Main-207+,Stussi,0,0,0,,And Authority Chip holders\Nlike us are the fourth.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.46,0:15:38.75,Main-207+,Stussi,0,0,0,,{\q2}No matter what we do, Sentomaru's commands\Nwill always be prioritized!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.00,0:15:43.38,Main-207+,Kaku,0,0,0,,{\q2}[KAKU]\NThen why don't we make a call\Nto the Five Elders and have them take control?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.38,0:15:44.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It doesn't work that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.72,0:15:47.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pacifistas have to receive\Ntheir commands directly.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.38,0:15:53.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They won't react to a transponder snail,\NEven if it's the Five Elders calling!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.39,0:15:57.90,Main-207+,Kaku,0,0,0,,[KAKU]\NThen what are we supposed to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.90,0:16:01.40,Main-207+,Kaku,0,0,0,,{\q2}The seraphim are valuable Government property,\NWe can't just destroy them!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.40,0:16:02.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Darn it, Lucci.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.36,0:16:04.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You really didn't think this through!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.46,0:16:24.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}You ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.47,0:16:28.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Gum-Gum...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.10,0:16:37.56,Main-207+,Sentomaru,0,0,0,,Time to do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.56,0:16:39.06,Main-207+,Sentomaru,0,0,0,,First, S-Snake,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.06,0:16:41.65,Main-207+,Sentomaru,0,0,0,,guide Straw Hat and his friends\Nto the Vacuum Rocket!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.06,0:16:44.32,Main-207+,Sentomaru,0,0,0,,They need to make it to the Frontier Dome!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.86,0:16:46.82,Main-207+,Sentomaru,0,0,0,,S-Hawk, S-Shark!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.82,0:16:48.82,Main-207+,Sentomaru,0,0,0,,Hold CP0 back!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.82,0:16:52.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Chopper, do those children look\Nfamiliar to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.28,0:16:57.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Apart from the black wings and the flames,\Nthey all look like former Warlords of the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.41,0:16:58.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're right!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.54,0:17:00.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's no way that's a coincidence!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.75,0:17:04.50,Main-207+,Jimbei,0,0,0,,[JIMBEI]\NThe Government\Nmust have made clones out of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.92,0:17:07.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! Axe Guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.38,0:17:12.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's been a while, old buddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.10,0:17:14.47,Main-207+,Sentomaru,0,0,0,,Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.10,0:17:18.10,Main-207+,Sentomaru,0,0,0,,Current circumstances aside,\Nyou and I are enemies.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.10,0:17:20.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And I have a name!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.31,0:17:24.02,Main-207+,Sentomaru,0,0,0,,So, what? You're helping Punk escape?\NDo I have that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.52,0:17:26.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh. I like his apple head.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.40,0:17:27.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And he asked.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.23,0:17:30.36,Main-207+,Sentomaru,0,0,0,,Well, that doesn't exactly fill\Nme with confidence,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.36,0:17:32.74,Main-207+,Sentomaru,0,0,0,,but I suppose you are an Emperor now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.42,0:17:44.47,Main-207+,Lucci,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Hand pistol.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.55,0:17:51.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Black sky!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.26,0:17:54.60,Main-207+,Lucci,0,0,0,,[LUCCI]\NThat takes care of their commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.97,0:17:58.81,Main-207+,Lucci,0,0,0,,Seraphim! You follow our orders now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.98,0:18:01.94,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NI'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.94,0:18:04.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I distracted you and now you're dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.19,0:18:07.27,Main-207+,Sentomaru,0,0,0,,[SENTOMARU]\NIdiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.03,0:18:09.61,Main-207+,Sentomaru,0,0,0,,You didn't distract me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.94,0:18:11.61,Main-207+,Sentomaru,0,0,0,,I saw that hit coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.33,0:18:20.50,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Ugh! Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.63,0:18:28.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I was so sure...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.63,0:18:29.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I blocked in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.02,0:18:41.77,Main-207+,Lucci,0,0,0,,Hurry up and die.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.52,0:18:45.15,Main-207+,Lucci,0,0,0,,I can't take control until you're unconscious.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.27,0:19:29.31,Main-207+,Lucci,0,0,0,,{\q2}[LUCCI]\NI'm sure you thought you had a fine strategy,\Noverriding our orders to the seraphim,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.31,0:19:32.69,Main-207+,Lucci,0,0,0,,but all you did was put\Na nail in your own coffin!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.01,0:19:58.84,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}[LUFFY]\NGum-Gum...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.86,0:20:18.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lucci.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.62,0:20:27.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.71,0:20:28.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hurry, Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.83,0:20:32.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If we want to save this girl's life, then we have\Nto get to Vegapunk's lab immediately!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.21,0:20:36.92,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NI mean, it's not\Nlike I don't want to, but, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.27,0:20:48.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't stop spinning!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.40,0:20:56.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whoa! You really can't stop spinning!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.86,0:21:02.99,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NSorry, kids, I'm going underground!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.29,0:21:08.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,To the factory!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.86,0:21:40.11,Main-207+,Kaku,0,0,0,,Is there nothing we can do\Nto stop these things?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.11,0:21:42.61,Main-207+,Kaku,0,0,0,,We're losing men to our own weapons!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.61,0:21:44.12,Main-207+,Stussy,0,0,0,,[STUSSY]\NI shudder to imagine
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.12,0:21:46.55,Main-207+,Stussy,0,0,0,,how strong they'll be once they grow up.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.16,0:21:49.30,Main-207+,Franky,0,0,0,,[FRANKY]\NHey, Vegapunk!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.71,0:21:51.67,Main-207+,Vegapunk,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.67,0:21:55.38,Main-207+,Franky,0,0,0,,[FRANKY]\NTell me the truth.\NWhat is that power?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.38,0:21:57.75,Main-207+,Franky,0,0,0,,And what the hell is that Jinbe\Nthing doin' with it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.75,0:22:00.76,Main-207+,Franky,0,0,0,,'Cause that looks\Nlike the Swim-Swim Fruit to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.76,0:22:02.26,Main-207+,Nami,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NWhat's the Swim-Swim Fruit?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.26,0:22:03.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's his.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.88,0:22:08.68,Main-207+,Franky,0,0,0,,My hard-boiled brother from another mother,\Nseñor Pink, has that power.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.68,0:22:12.44,Main-207+,Franky,0,0,0,,I'd recognize it anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.57,0:22:19.99,Main-207+,Franky,0,0,0,,[FRANKY]\NBut it's impossible\Nfor there to be two of the same devil fruit,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.99,0:22:22.82,Main-207+,Franky,0,0,0,,so that means my bro must have died!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.62,0:22:27.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ah! My poor bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.49,0:22:29.62,Main-207+,Vegapunk,0,0,0,,So you would think.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.62,0:22:33.00,Main-207+,Vegapunk,0,0,0,,But he's not dead.\NHe's just being held in Impel Down.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.54,0:22:36.13,Main-207+,Franky,0,0,0,,Hold up.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.13,0:22:39.55,Main-207+,Franky,0,0,0,,Does that mean you found a way\Nto duplicate devil fruits?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.96,0:22:44.47,Main-207+,Vegapunk,0,0,0,,[VEGAPUNK]\NWell,\Nsome devil fruits can be copied.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.39,0:22:50.56,Main-207+,Vegapunk,0,0,0,,But it only works with zoan-types.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.19,0:22:58.69,Main-207+,Vegapunk,0,0,0,,Hm. Though the less said\Nabout Caesar's SMILE experiments, the better.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.69,0:23:00.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah. He can go straight to hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.99,0:23:07.24,Main-207+,Vegapunk,0,0,0,,The SMILEs offer a high risk\Nand low success rate.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.62,0:23:11.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They only work one time out of ten.\NAnd those who aren't granted power
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.66,0:23:16.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,never stop smiling or laughing. They can't\Neven mourn for their lost loved ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.12,0:23:16.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.29,0:23:19.09,Main-207+,Franky,0,0,0,,[FRANKY]\NCaesar.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.09,0:23:22.05,Main-207+,Franky,0,0,0,,Just hearin' his name again makes\Nme wanna blow chunks.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.01,0:23:27.26,Main-207+,Vegapunk,0,0,0,,[VEGAPUNK]\NOh, aberrations\Nsuch as those notwithstanding,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.47,0:23:32.89,Main-207+,Vegapunk,0,0,0,,I have not given up. If we had\Nenough funding, and enough time,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.89,0:23:36.48,Main-207+,Vegapunk,0,0,0,,we could replicate any devil fruit in the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.36,0:23:41.19,Main-207+,Vegapunk,0,0,0,,[VEGAPUNK]\NOh. I'm not sure\Nif they'll Awaken.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.70,0:23:52.87,Main-207+,Vegapunk,0,0,0,,I've tried to recreate logia powers,\Nbut I've had no luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.42,0:23:47.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hm.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.87,0:23:54.77,Main-207+,Vegapunk,0,0,0,,And yet...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.23,0:23:57.75,Main-207+,Vegapunk,0,0,0,,For a Paramythia Fruit, I need only
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.75,0:24:00.63,Main-207+,Vegapunk,0,0,0,,acquire the Bloodline Elements of its owner.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.63,0:24:04.38,Main-207+,Vegapunk,0,0,0,,Then, I can synthesize a special compound\Nwhich, when administered,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.38,0:24:08.22,Main-207+,Vegapunk,0,0,0,,confers the... devil fruit power\Nto another person.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.89,0:24:13.18,Main-207+,Vegapunk,0,0,0,,[VEGAPUNK]\NObserve!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.22,0:24:17.23,Main-207+,Vegapunk,0,0,0,,That's the fluid you see flowing\Nthrough the seraphim's arms!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.40,0:24:20.69,Main-207+,Vegapunk,0,0,0,,The Green Blood!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.07,0:24:25.65,Main-207+,Franky,0,0,0,,Hold up! You made a new kind of blood?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.03,0:24:30.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Love-Love...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.61,0:24:34.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Beam!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.04,0:24:48.31,Main-207+,Vegapunk,0,0,0,,[VEGAPUNK]\NI believe that seraphim represent\Nthe pinnacle of modern scientific possibility!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.09,0:24:52.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}A...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.73,0:25:02.90,Main-207+,Vegapunk,0,0,0,,[VEGAPUNK]\NDo you know\Nwhat that makes them?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.02,0:25:07.49,Main-207+,Vegapunk,0,0,0,,The strongest form of humanity in history!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.86,0:25:10.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is that why the Government got rid of them?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.20,0:25:14.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Why the hell would you even make\Nsomething stronger than a Warlord, you psychopath?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.37,0:25:18.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're Navy weapons. Killing machines.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.16,0:25:18.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.37,0:25:22.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And sooner or later, they'll be aiming for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.84,0:25:34.68,Main-207+,Citizen B,0,0,0,,[CITIZEN B]\NHold on, Sentomaru!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.18,0:25:37.62,Main-207+,Sentomaru,0,0,0,,[SENTOMARU]\NStay back!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.06,0:25:40.89,Main-207+,Sentomaru,0,0,0,,This isn't over yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.41,0:25:55.70,Main-207+,Citizen C,0,0,0,,[CITIZEN C]\NSentomaru, please stay safe!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.45,0:26:00.66,Main-207+,Lucci,0,0,0,,Now, where did that little friend\Nof yours run off to?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.29,0:26:03.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't know!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.17,0:26:04.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And he's not my friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.13,0:26:08.21,Main-207+,Lucci,0,0,0,,What a shame. Guess you're all alone, traitor.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.01,0:28:18.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Broken!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.35,0:28:23.81,Thoughts-207+,Lucci,0,0,0,,[LUCCI]\NWhen did he get so powerful?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.56,0:28:27.73,Thoughts-207+,Lucci,0,0,0,,[LUCCI]\NDamn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.19,0:28:33.02,Thoughts-207+,Lucci,0,0,0,,[LUCCI]\NI'm losing consciousness!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.87,0:28:46.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Follow me! Quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.18,0:28:58.51,Main-207+,S-Snake,0,0,0,,[S-SNAKE]\NI said, hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.26,0:29:04.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is no time to be dragging\Nyour feet, you fools.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.85,0:29:06.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Vacuum Rocket is right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.77,0:29:09.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now get on!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.06,0:29:11.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why, thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.73,0:29:14.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You know, you're much\Nkinder than the real Hancock!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.11,0:29:16.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We owe you one!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.23,0:29:17.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Much obliged!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.86,0:29:19.20,Main-207+,S-Snake,0,0,0,,[S-SNAKE]\NWhat? D-Don't be absurd!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.70,0:29:22.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I-I'm just following orders, alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.29,0:29:30.25,Main-207+,Announcer B,0,0,0,,{\i1}[ANNOUNCER B]\NVacuum Rocket\Ndeparting in one minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.25,0:29:32.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on, we're out of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.79,0:29:36.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.63,0:29:39.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What do I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.92,0:29:43.93,Main-207+,Announcer B,0,0,0,,{\i1}[ANNOUNCER B]\NAttention.\NPlease take caution while boarding the rocket.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.93,0:29:45.31,Main-207+,Sentomaru,0,0,0,,[SENTOMARU]\NStraw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.28,0:29:51.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Go! And take care of Punk! You hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.77,0:29:54.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.69,0:29:56.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Leave it to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.69,0:30:00.65,Main-207+,Sentomaru,0,0,0,,[SENTOMARU]\NNo!\NYou're going the wrong way!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.03,0:30:06.76,Main-207+,Announcer B,0,0,0,,{\i1}[ANNOUNCER B]\NCaution.\NDoors closing in ten seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.75,0:30:20.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're gonna get him off this island.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.80,0:30:24.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No matter what. I promise!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.07,0:30:45.17,Main-207+,Announcer B,0,0,0,,{\i1}[ANNOUNCER B]\NPrepare to launch.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.53,0:30:37.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Doors closing.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.62,0:30:51.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is so neat.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.42,0:31:02.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's certainly something right!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.01,0:31:05.47,Main-207+,Bonney,0,0,0,,[BONNEY]\NWhat happened to Vegapunk?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.26,0:31:11.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where's pigeon guy? Let me out of...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.14,0:31:13.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1420,1053)}Whoa. Who the hell is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.02,0:31:14.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\pos(462,590)}It's Luffy. He's just tired!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.64,0:31:16.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\pos(462,590)}I'll give you the details later!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.40,0:31:18.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1420,1053)}How long was I passed out?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.86,0:31:22.40,Main-207+,Chopper,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NOkay, maybe I'll get used to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.40,0:31:23.69,Main-207+,Chopper,0,0,0,,Please shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.69,0:31:24.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.45,0:31:28.76,Main-207+,Bonney,0,0,0,,[BONNEY]\NEasy does it. You shut up,\Ntoo, grandpa! Go back to normal already!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.28,0:31:36.21,Main-207+,Announcer B,0,0,0,,{\i1}[ANNOUNCER B]\NDeparting Fabriophase.\NEntering Labophase.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.13,0:31:41.25,Main-207+,Announcer B,0,0,0,,{\i1}[ANNOUNCER B]\NTransit duration:
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.42,0:31:43.80,Main-207+,Announcer B,0,0,0,,{\i1}Thirty-two seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.63,0:31:46.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You have arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.51,0:31:47.80,Main-207+,Bonney,0,0,0,,[BONNEY]\NAlready?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.80,0:31:50.85,Main-207+,Announcer B,0,0,0,,{\q2}{\i1}[ANNOUNCER B]\NAll subsequent rockets are canceled.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.85,0:31:53.14,Main-207+,Announcer A,0,0,0,,{\i1}[ANNOUNCER A]\NLabophase under lockdown.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.14,0:31:55.10,Main-207+,Announcer A,0,0,0,,{\i1}Frontier Dome security system engaged.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.73,0:31:58.17,Main-207+,Announcer A,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hostile intruder alert.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.56,0:32:04.03,Main-207+,Announcer A,0,0,0,,{\i1}All researchers, evacuate to the factory\Nimmediately and seal all entry points.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.20,0:32:13.70,Main-207+,Kaku,0,0,0,,Well, I will say this for the man.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.87,0:32:18.04,Main-207+,Kaku,0,0,0,,He was a faithful bodyguard to Vegapunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.21,0:32:20.67,Main-207+,Kaku,0,0,0,,Until his dying breath.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.42,0:32:22.38,Main-207+,Kaku,0,0,0,,Such a waste.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.88,0:32:25.05,Main-207+,Kaku,0,0,0,,Didn't have to end like this, Sentomaru.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.05,0:32:29.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Need I remind you, our orders are to wait\Nfor the Navy before making a move.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.39,0:32:31.47,Main-207+,Lucci,0,0,0,,They can twiddle their thumbs all they like,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.93,0:32:34.02,Main-207+,Lucci,0,0,0,,but I won't wait for Vegapunk to escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.93,0:32:37.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What do they even stand\Nto gain from killing you?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.27,0:32:39.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're the smartest man in the world,\Nand you're on their side.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.35,0:32:43.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If they do this, it'll be a huge loss for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.44,0:32:44.65,Main-207+,Vegapunk,0,0,0,,Well, I think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.65,0:32:48.53,Main-207+,Vegapunk,0,0,0,,But it appears that the higher-ups have\Na different perspective.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.86,0:32:54.66,Main-207+,Vegapunk,0,0,0,,I certainly made inventions that have been\Nbeneficial to the World Government.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.66,0:32:58.41,Main-207+,Vegapunk,0,0,0,,Innovations in navigation technology\Nusing sea prism stones.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.41,0:33:00.79,Main-207+,Vegapunk,0,0,0,,Cyborg animal modifications.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.42,0:33:05.88,Main-207+,Vegapunk,0,0,0,,Not to mention my research on devil fruits\Nthat's unlocked their secrets.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.88,0:33:08.80,Main-207+,Vegapunk,0,0,0,,Or my creation of human weapons\Nwith the pacifistas.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.76,0:33:11.18,Main-207+,Vegapunk,0,0,0,,And now, I've
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.28,0:33:14.22,Main-207+,Vegapunk,0,0,0,,completed the seraphim as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.60,0:33:20.19,Main-207+,Vegapunk,0,0,0,,{\q2}Now imagine if you thought I might turn\Nthat frightful intelligence against you. What would you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.52,0:33:21.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,In that case,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.40,0:33:23.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,there's no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.65,0:33:24.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.31,0:33:27.15,Main-207+,Vegapunk,0,0,0,,I said, I will not!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.15,0:33:32.49,Main-207+,Vegapunk,0,0,0,,For the record, I never planned to revolt.\NI still need my research funding, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.49,0:33:36.33,Main-207+,Vegapunk,0,0,0,,But the powers that be decided\NI was trouble, and that was that.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.70,0:33:40.21,Main-207+,Vegapunk,0,0,0,,Alas, life gives you lemons,\Ngovernment tries to kill you for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.21,0:33:42.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That is not how the expression\Ngoes, and you know it!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.25,0:33:47.51,Main-207+,Vegapunk,0,0,0,,Just when I faced this quandary, an Emperor\Nand his crew appeared before me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.51,0:33:49.84,Main-207+,Vegapunk,0,0,0,,Fate brought us together,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.84,0:33:50.38,Main-207+,Vegapunk,0,0,0,,don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.51,0:33:53.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hold it! You mean you want to join our crew?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.89,0:33:55.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Welcome aboard, crewmate!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.14,0:33:58.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Super!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.22,0:34:01.02,Main-207+,Franky,0,0,0,,Which of my babies do you want to see first?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.02,0:34:04.48,Main-207+,Franky,0,0,0,,The {\i1}Sunny{\i0}? General Franky?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.48,0:34:07.32,Main-207+,Kaku,0,0,0,,[KAKU]\NWhat? So we have to take him?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.32,0:34:08.69,Main-207+,Kaku,0,0,0,,Well, this sucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.07,0:34:10.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't you worry, Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.86,0:34:12.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm on bodyguard duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.57,0:34:14.53,Main-207+,Vegapunk,0,0,0,,Oh my, what a gentleman.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.53,0:34:16.45,Main-207+,Vegapunk,0,0,0,,Thank you, I feel much safer now.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.87,0:34:17.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.58,0:34:20.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shut up and unlock\Nthese shitty shoes already!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.08,0:34:21.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I wasn't talking to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.79,0:34:24.08,Main-207+,Egghead Citizen K,0,0,0,,[EGGHEAD CITIZEN K]\NOh no! Atlas!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.08,0:34:25.04,Main-207+,Egghead Citizen K,0,0,0,,This is serious!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.04,0:34:26.50,Main-207+,Egghead Citizen K,0,0,0,,She's not moving at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.84,0:34:28.63,Main-207+,Egghead Citizen K,0,0,0,,Don't worry, we'll save you!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.96,0:34:32.43,Main-207+,Egghead Citizen K,0,0,0,,Ready a repair session\Nimmediately! Patient incoming!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.43,0:34:34.72,Main-207+,Egghead Citizen K,0,0,0,,Thank you for bringing her in.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.72,0:34:36.10,Main-207+,Egghead Citizen K,0,0,0,,You can leave the rest to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.43,0:34:37.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Of course, good luck!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.81,0:34:40.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, screws for brains!\NWhere the hell is Vegapunk?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.73,0:34:43.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I know he's in here somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.73,0:34:45.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tell me now!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.31,0:34:47.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bonney, stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.23,0:34:49.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You need to calm down!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.69,0:34:54.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait a sec! Is this his lab?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.18,0:34:57.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wow! So cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.99,0:35:00.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you seeing this, Buddy?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.12,0:35:02.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That ancient bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.16,0:35:05.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm {\i1}gonna{\i0} make him pay!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.30,0:35:11.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bonney! Wait, where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.72,0:35:19.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I told Vegapunk to turn my father back\Nto normal, and what did he do?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.39,0:35:22.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He sicked bugs on me!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.10,0:35:29.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm going to Bury him for this!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.11,0:35:31.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't think the bugs were his fault, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.99,0:35:34.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bonney, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.57,0:35:36.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We need to stick together!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.11,0:35:38.32,Main-207+,Chopper,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NHey, come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.84,0:35:54.72,Main-207+,Kaku,0,0,0,,Our authority chips are finally back in effect.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.72,0:35:57.22,Main-207+,Kaku,0,0,0,,The seraphim follow our orders now.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.76,0:35:59.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who's ready for a little revenge?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.26,0:36:02.56,Main-207+,Lucci,0,0,0,,I took down one of the satellites.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.93,0:36:08.15,Main-207+,Lucci,0,0,0,,Including Vegapunk himself,\Nthere are six more. This might not be easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.15,0:36:11.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's assuming we can even get to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.15,0:36:11.98,Main-207+,Kaku,0,0,0,,Trust me,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.48,0:36:15.85,Main-207+,Kaku,0,0,0,,that defense system is nothing to scoff at.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.89,0:36:20.45,Main-207+,Lucci,0,0,0,,We'll see how long it lasts against our forces.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.45,0:36:22.20,Main-207+,Lucci,0,0,0,,Lock down the island.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.20,0:36:24.16,Main-207+,Lucci,0,0,0,,Destroy every last ship you can find.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.29,0:36:27.79,Main-207+,Lucci,0,0,0,,No one escapes Egghead on our watch!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.79,0:36:43.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh. The Straw Hats are protecting\NVegapunk. How nice of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.10,0:36:47.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm sure they'll be a big help.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.52,0:36:52.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Too bad. They still won't escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.07,0:36:59.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're in for one hell of a surprise, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.78,0:37:04.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Alright. Proceed according to plan, boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.70,0:37:07.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Send every last ship we have...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.12,0:37:11.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...to Egghead Island.
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{=35}===============================DIALOGUE============================
